<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page meal-record-page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><block wx:if="{{type==='exercise'}}">
<view class="eyebrow">A NOTE TO MYSELF</view><view class="heading">{{type === 'meal' ? '好好吃饭，也值得记录。' : type === 'exercise' ? '动一动，心情也轻一点。' : '每一次变化，都慢慢来。'}}</view><view class="subtitle">记录只保存在你自己的健康日记中。</view><view class="card section"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">记录日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="picker">{{form.date}} ⌄</view></picker></view><block wx:if="{{type === 'meal'}}"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">餐次</text><picker range="{{slots}}" value="{{slotIndex}}" bindchange="slotChange"><view class="picker">{{slots[slotIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">吃了些什么</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如 鸡肉蔬菜饭" maxlength="40" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">估算热量 / kcal</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="例如 520" value="{{form.kcal}}" data-field="kcal" bindinput="input"/></view></block><block wx:elif="{{type === 'exercise'}}"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">今天做了什么运动</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如 饭后散步" maxlength="40" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">运动时长 / 分钟</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="例如 30" value="{{form.minutes}}" data-field="minutes" bindinput="input"/></view></block><view wx:else class="form-field"><text class="form-label">体重 / kg</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="例如 61.5" value="{{form.kg}}" data-field="kg" bindinput="input"/><view class="form-hint">体重记录仅自己可见，不会显示在打卡榜上。</view></view><button class="btn" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存这份记录</button></view>
</block></block><view class="footnote" wx:if="{{type==='exercise'}}">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view><block wx:if="{{type==='meal' && !loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CARE FOR YOURSELF</view><view class="row"><view class="meal-heading">好好吃饭，也好好记录</view><button class="meal-photo-link" bindtap="photo">拍照识餐</button></view><view class="subtitle">选食物、填克数，这一餐的热量会自动合计。</view><view class="meal-date-card"><view class="row"><text class="title">这餐记在</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="dateChange"><text class="meal-date-value">{{form.date}} ⌄</text></picker></view><view class="meal-slots"><button wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="*this" class="meal-slot {{slotIndex===index?'meal-slot-active':''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="mealSlot">{{item}}</button></view></view><input class="meal-search" value="{{query}}" bindinput="searchFoods" placeholder="搜索食物，如：鸡蛋、米饭"/><view class="section-head section"><view><view class="section-title">常见食物</view><view class="caption">以下热量均按每100克可食部计算</view></view><text class="small-text">{{shownFoods.length}} 种</text></view><view class="meal-food-list"><button wx:for="{{shownFoods}}" wx:key="key" class="meal-food-row" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectFood"><view class="meal-food-symbol"><image class="meal-food-icon" src="/images/ui/cup.svg"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="meal-food-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="meal-food-caption">{{item.kcalLabel}} 千卡 / 100 克 · {{item.group}}</view></view><text class="meal-food-plus">＋</text></button><view wx:if="{{!shownFoods.length}}" class="empty">暂未找到，可在下方手动填写。</view><button wx:if="{{!query}}" class="meal-more" bindtap="moreFoods">{{expanded?'收起更多食物':'查看更多食物'}}</button></view><view class="meal-reference">食物数据仅作记录参考，不同品牌和做法会有差异。当前为本地食物与配方示例。</view><view wx:if="{{basket.length}}" class="card mt"><view class="title">这一餐已选</view><view class="record-row" wx:for="{{basket}}" wx:key="index"><view class="grow"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.grams}} {{item.unit==='ml'?'毫升':'克'}} · {{item.lineKcal}} 千卡</view></view><button class="delete" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeFood">移除</button></view></view><button class="meal-manual-link" bindtap="toggleManual">{{manual?'收起手动填写':'找不到食物？直接填写营养热量 ›'}}</button><view wx:if="{{manual}}" class="card mt"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">吃了些什么</text><input class="input" placeholder="填写餐食名称" maxlength="40" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">估算热量 / 千卡</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="填写这餐热量" value="{{form.kcal}}" data-field="kcal" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="btn" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存手动记录</button></view><view wx:if="{{selectedFood}}" class="meal-food-sheet"><view class="title">{{selectedFood.name}}</view><view class="caption">{{selectedFood.unit==='ml'?'实际饮用量 / ml':'实际食用克数 / g'}}</view><input class="input mt" type="digit" value="{{grams}}" bindinput="grams"/><view class="footer-buttons mt"><button class="btn soft" bindtap="cancelFood">取消</button><button class="btn" bindtap="addFood">加入这一餐</button></view></view><view class="meal-footer"><view class="meal-footer-total">已选 {{basket.length}} 项<view>{{totalKcal}} 千卡</view></view><button class="meal-complete" bindtap="completeMeal" disabled="{{busy || !basket.length}}">完成记录</button></view></block><block wx:if="{{type==='weight' && !loading && !error}}"><view class="weight-entry-motto">数字有起伏，坚持有意义。</view><view class="weight-entry-card"><view class="row"><text class="weight-entry-label">本次体重</text><text class="weight-entry-unit-pill">千克 kg</text></view><view class="weight-input-wrap"><input class="weight-entry-input" type="digit" value="{{form.kg}}" data-field="kg" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入体重" placeholder-class="weight-entry-placeholder"/><text class="weight-entry-unit">kg</text></view><view class="weight-entry-stats"><view><view class="weight-entry-value">{{weightInitial}}</view><text>起始体重 kg</text></view><view><view class="weight-entry-value weight-entry-purple">{{weightDelta}}</view><text>累计变化 kg</text></view><view><view class="weight-entry-value">{{weightTarget}}</view><text>个人目标 kg</text></view></view><view class="weight-entry-caption">{{weightInitial==='—'?'保存第一条体重后显示起始体重与累计变化。':form.kg?'累计变化按本次输入体重与起始体重比较。':'累计变化按最近记录与起始体重比较。'}}</view></view><view class="weight-entry-card"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">记录日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="picker">{{form.date}}<text class="weight-date-arrow">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">今天的状态（选填）</text><input class="input" value="{{form.note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：晨起空腹，睡得很好"/></view></view><view class="notice weight-entry-notice"><image class="weight-entry-leaf" src="/images/ui/leaf.svg"/><text>每天尽量在相近条件下称重。一次波动，并不代表脂肪变化。</text></view><button class="weight-entry-save btn" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !form.kg}}">{{weightEditing?'保存修改':'保存今日体重'}}</button></block></view>